        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the matching jungle of Fit My Cat's wild and wacky animal edition!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: your Zoo pals have embarked on a lavish holiday retreat to an exclusive hotel with a sprawling pool oasis, just for them. But there's a snag – they're all vying for space on a colossal floatie, and they need your finesse to make it work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level unveils a menagerie of creatures, each itching for a spot to lounge and unwind on the floatie. Get ready to mingle with 28 different breeds, from slinky snakes to cuddly pandas, regal lions to quirky capybaras, and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Here's what makes this ZOOOOOish escapade roar to life:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 levels of floaties ready to be filled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 different animals with different shapes and sized</p></li></ul>",
